  "applies_to": "Setra Power Meter (SPM) multi-load electrical meters; this entry covers the root device that carries the voltage inputs.",
  "summary": "The Setra Power Meter measures several electrical loads from shared voltage inputs. Over BACnet the root device holds the readings for the two voltage inputs (Vin1, Vin2): line and line-to-line voltages, phase angles, harmonic distortion, frequency and energy, plus the service type and two pulse inputs. Per-load power and energy live in separate load devices.",
