  "access_inferred": true,
  "notes": [
    "The meter shows up as more than one BACnet device: a root device for the voltage inputs and load device(s) with their own object list. The root and load lists are separate entries in this library.",
    "The list has no read/write column; all objects are shown read-only here (access inferred).",
    "The object list does not say which BACnet network the meter uses (BACnet IP or BACnet MS/TP); check Setra's SPM data sheet for the model.",
    "AI 15-20 are not listed; Vin2 starts at AI 21.",
    "The Pulse Converter objects are listed here with type \"Other\".",
    "Device Object_Name defaults to \"Setra Power Meter\" and can be changed."
  ],
